得之若得一敵國云。劇孟行大類朱家，而好博，多少年之戲。然劇孟母死，自遠方送喪蓋千乘。及劇孟死，家無餘十金之財。而符離人王孟亦以俠稱江淮之間。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"田仲","kind":"person","person_id":"qg3_81p_5ti","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"朱家","kind":"person","person_id":"766_5dq_zws","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"田仲","kind":"person","person_id":"qg3_81p_5ti","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"朱家","kind":"person","person_id":"766_5dq_zws","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0134","start":134,"end":137,"surface":"劇孟母","kind":"person","person_id":"qel_t1a_itz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"劇孟","kind":"person","person_id":"5se_9f5_u2q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-124-youxia:m007-0165","start":165,"end"